{"content":[{"c":["EPHER"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Son of Midian and grandson of Abraham through his concubine Keturah, whose tribe was sent to the east. Some were supportive of Abraham’s descendants and others became enemies (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.25.4","r":"Gen.25.4","rawR":"Gen.25.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.25.4","value":"Gen.25.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 25:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.33","r":"1Chr.1.33","rawR":"1Chr.1.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.33","value":"1Chr.1.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:33"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Son of Ezrah from Judah’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.17","r":"1Chr.4.17","rawR":"1Chr.4.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.17","value":"1Chr.4.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:17"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Head of a household and a great warrior in the half-tribe of Manasseh. He lived between Bashan and Mt Hermon (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.5.24","r":"1Chr.5.24","rawR":"1Chr.5.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.5.24","value":"1Chr.5.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 5:24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Epher","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 25:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.25.4","rawQueryValue":"Gen.25.4","sourceRefExact":"Gen.25.4"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.33","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.33","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.33"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 4:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.17"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 5:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.5.24","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.5.24","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.5.24"}],"sourceItemF